<.site_nav active={:about} />

<main id="about-page" class="about-page">
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="container about-hero-grid">
      <div class="about-hero-copy">
        <span class="label animate-fade-up animated">About PickPod</span>
        <h1 class="headline-xl mb-4 animate-fade-up animated delay-100">
          A small fix for a habit that finally stuck.
        </h1>
        <p class="body-lg animate-fade-up animated delay-200">
          PickPod began with a bag of floss picks, a daily drive, and one obvious problem:
          there was nowhere clean to put the picks after using them.
        </p>
      </div>
      <figure class="about-hero-image animate-scale-in animated delay-200">
        <img
          src={~p"/images/pickpod-in-car.webp"}
          alt="PickPod holding floss picks within reach in a parked car cupholder"
          width="1440"
          height="960"
        />
        <figcaption>Made for the moments already built into your day.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="why-pickpod" class="section about-intro">
    <div class="container about-intro-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="story-number animate-on-scroll">01</span>
        <h2 class="headline-lg animate-on-scroll">Why PickPod?</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="story-copy animate-on-scroll">
        <p>
          I started flossing in my car, but I kept leaving used floss picks in cupholders,
          door pockets, and random places. I realized there wasn’t a simple way to keep
          clean picks accessible while also having a place to dispose of used ones.
        </p>
        <p class="story-emphasis">That’s what led to PickPod.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="founder-story" class="section section-light">
    <div class="container story-shell">
      <div class="story-heading">
        <span class="story-number animate-on-scroll">02</span>
        <span class="label animate-on-scroll">From advice to idea</span>
        <h2 class="headline-lg animate-on-scroll">The Story Behind PickPod</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="story-timeline">
        <article class="story-step animate-fade-up">
          <span class="story-step-marker">1</span>
          <div>
            <h3>The tip</h3>
            <p>
              A few years ago, I was determined to turn flossing into a habit. Then I
              remembered a simple tip my friend’s dentist gave her: buy a bag of floss
              picks and keep them in your car. You’re in there every day anyway—make it
              part of the routine.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="story-step animate-fade-up">
          <span class="story-step-marker">2</span>
          <div>
            <h3>The mess</h3>
            <p>
              I borrowed that advice, and it worked. I finally started flossing
              consistently—but used picks began collecting in cupholders, door pockets,
              and random places. Clean and used picks mixed together. It was scattered,
              inconvenient, and kind of gross.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="story-step animate-fade-up">
          <span class="story-step-marker">3</span>
          <div>
            <h3>The build</h3>
            <p>
              I looked for something that kept clean picks accessible and gave used picks
              a separate place to go. Nothing existed, so I built it. PickPod was created
              to solve the mess while making flossing more convenient and consistent.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section founder-note-section">
    <div class="container founder-note animate-scale-in">
      <span class="founder-note-mark" aria-hidden="true">“</span>
      <blockquote>
        I’ve used PickPod for a while now, and having floss picks within reach has helped
        me floss more consistently while keeping my space clean.
      </blockquote>
      <p>One clean pick. One place for the used one. One habit that lasts.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section about-cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-cta animate-scale-in">
        <span class="label">Grab. Floss. Toss.</span>
        <h2 class="headline-md mb-3">Make room for a cleaner routine.</h2>
        <p class="body-lg text-muted mb-4">
          Join the waitlist and be first to know when PickPod launches.
        </p>
        <a href={~p"/#notify"} class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" id="about-waitlist-cta">
          Join the Waitlist
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<.site_footer />
